@startuml D39g-gate-signoff
!include ../includes/C4_Sequence_Macros.puml

title D39g — Gate sign-off (Security / AO slots)\nARCH-GATE-SIGNOFF — cyber ship or locked migrate

C4Seq_User()
C4Seq_WebUI()
C4Seq_RouteGuard()
C4Seq_API()
C4Seq_RBAC()
C4Seq_Business()
C4Seq_Data()
C4Seq_Postgres()
C4Seq_Audit()
C4Seq_OTEL()

note over seqUser, seqOTEL
  **gate_signoff** rows = pass condition for Gates that need
  slot decisions beyond line ApprovalRecord.
  **cyber_gate** on release = **trigger** that causes
  gate-cyber-ship / gate-signoff-complete to evaluate (G61).
  Also used for AO/Security on locked catalog migrate
  before re-approve (with D39d mint_kind=pin).
end note

== Record sign-off ==

seqUser -> seqWebUI : Sign off (approve|deny) for slot
RbacRouteGuard("gate:signoff")
ClientScopedQuery("POST", "/clients/{clientId}/gate-signoffs")
ControlNote(seqAPI, "SC-8, AC-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "gate_signoff write API; subject_kind + gate_id + slot")

seqAPI -> seqBusiness : createGateSignoff(actor, subject, gate_id, slot, decision)
ControlNote(seqBusiness, "AC-3, CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Slots: security_signoff, ao_approve (RoleBinding)")

RbacCheck("gate:signoff")
ControlNote(seqRBAC, "AC-3, AC-6", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Security/AO (or bound roles) only — not free Author pin edit")

HookEval("gate:signoff")
note right of seqBusiness
  Sign-off itself is the slot decision record.
  Ship (**G61**) later GateChecks gate-signoff-complete
  requiring these rows when cyber_gate triggers.
end note

seqBusiness -> seqData : insert gate_signoff
seqData -> seqPostgres : INSERT gate_signoff\n(subject_kind, subject_id, gate_id, slot,\nidentity_id, decision, at, note)
ControlNote(seqPostgres, "AC-3, AU-2", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "SoT for cyber/migrate slot decisions (ARCH-GATE-SIGNOFF)")
seqPostgres --> seqData : row
seqData --> seqBusiness : signoff

HookEffectsAfter("audit")
AuditLog("gate.signoff", "subject gate_id slot decision")
ControlNote(seqAudit, "AU-2, AU-3, AU-12", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Auditable Security/AO decision")

seqBusiness --> seqAPI : signoff DTO
seqAPI --> seqWebUI : 201 Created
seqWebUI --> seqUser : slot recorded

@enduml
